  "summary": {
    "text": "Student life at IIT Bhilai runs through the Council of Student Affairs (CoSA), split into a Student Gymkhana for technical, cultural, sports and outreach activity, and a Students' Senate for academic concerns. Gymkhana clubs span dance, music, theatre, creative writing, art, photography, electronics, coding, robotics and space exploration, plus an NSS unit running community-service drives. Meraz (techno-cultural) and Prayatna (intramural sports) anchor the yearly calendar; students also compete at the Inter-IIT Sports Meet.",
